{
 "plan": {
  "title": "Scholarship Processing Overview",
  "subtitle": "Monitoring application status and pending workloads across districts",
  "panels": [
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Total Applications",
    "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS total_apps FROM scholarship_applicants",
    "unit": ""
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "kind": "kpi",
    "title": "Pending Cases",
    "sql": "SELECT COUNT(*) AS pending_count FROM scholarship_applicants WHERE \"Status\" IN ('Pending', 'Under Review')",
    "unit": ""
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "kind": "bar",
    "title": "Pending vs Approved by District",
    "sql": "SELECT \"District\", COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE \"Status\" = 'Pending' OR \"Status\" = 'Under Review') AS pending_count, COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE \"Status\" = 'Approved' OR \"Status\" = 'Disbursed') AS approved_count FROM scholarship_applicants GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 2 DESC",
    "x": "District",
    "y": [
     "pending_count",
     "approved_count"
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "kind": "pie",
    "title": "Overall Status Distribution",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Status\", COUNT(*) AS status_count FROM scholarship_applicants GROUP BY 1",
    "x": "Status",
    "y": "status_count"
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "kind": "table",
    "title": "Detailed Pending List",
    "sql": "SELECT \"Naam\", \"District\", \"Taluka\", \"Name of scheme\", \"Status\" FROM scholarship_applicants WHERE \"Status\" IN ('Pending', 'Under Review') ORDER BY \"District\" ASC"
   }
  ],
  "narrative": "The current scholarship cycle has received {{p1.total_apps}} total applications. Out of these, {{p2.pending_count}} cases are currently awaiting action or are under review.\n\nDistrict-level analysis shows that the workload is distributed unevenly, with the highest number of pending cases concentrated in specific regions. The comparison between pending and approved counts per district helps identify where administrative bottlenecks may exist.\n\nFor a granular view of specific cases requiring immediate attention, please refer to the detailed pending list provided in the final panel."
 },
